sequenceDiagram
  participant App as App 房间层
  participant RTM as RTM SDK
  participant RTC as RTC SDK
  App->>App: 创建房间 store，绑定房间事件处理器
  App->>RTM: presence.setState(roomId, ...)
  App->>RTM: subscribe(roomId)
  RTM-->>App: subscribe 完成（频道已订阅）
  App->>RTC: 加入频道并订阅音频
  RTM-->>App: presence SNAPSHOT
  RTM-->>App: storage SNAPSHOT
  App->>App: 房间状态已就绪，开放麦位与公告相关操作
